(A practical guide for reviewing LLM-generated clinical cases) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 644 Tm
(Author: Douglas Henrique Duarte) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 616 Tm
(DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.20100687) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 588 Tm
